[14.284778, "o", "Linked 01a15931-3729-7000-9441-4c880d4f8f3a -refuses-a-write→ src/billing\r\n  src/billing covers 0 of 0 file(s) counted in the working tree; not counted: .git, .mnema.\r\n  Files on disk, not edits: a directory nobody touches counts the same as a busy one.\r\n  Landed in the public tree: committed with the repository, so it reaches every clone.\r\n"]
